    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Xeno Swarm&quot; is a hardcore retro side-scrolling shooter with a classic pixel art style. Players can choose between male and female protagonists to battle against overwhelming hordes of alien creatures. The game focuses on swarms of insects and epic giant boss fights, blending modern smooth controls with nostalgic arcade gameplay. Engage in life-or-death confrontations on oppressive alien battlefields and fight for humanity's last hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s retro arcade style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced side-scrolling shooter experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple primary weapon systems, auxiliary units, and energy weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant alien bosses and massive swarms of frenzied insects with diverse attack patterns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. The game is currently in development. Videos, new level screenshots, and a demo version will be released later. Stay tuned\u2014wishlist now! :D</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Xeno Swarm&quot; is a hardcore retro side-scrolling shooter with a classic pixel art style. Players can choose between male and female protagonists to battle against overwhelming hordes of alien creatures. The game focuses on swarms of insects and epic giant boss fights, blending modern smooth controls with nostalgic arcade gameplay. Engage in life-or-death confrontations on oppressive alien battlefields and fight for humanity's last hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s retro arcade style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced side-scrolling shooter experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple primary weapon systems, auxiliary units, and energy weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant alien bosses and massive swarms of frenzied insects with diverse attack patterns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. The game is currently in development. Videos, new level screenshots, and a demo version will be released later. Stay tuned\u2014wishlist now! :D</i></p>",
